[N 24-24 Darkshore: the short pass]
[D Forever Shaman 1-30 (Braedyn)\\Alternative to 23-24 Darkshore for a character who is already level 24 when Redridge ends: only the Darkshore steps that later chapters build on (the Auberdine flight path, the Blackfathom quests from Darnassus, Thundris' letter, the Prospector's fossil, the Tower of Althalaxx), then the road into Ashenvale.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffDarkshore, the short pass|r  -  use this chapter INSTEAD of 23-24 Darkshore when you leave Redridge already level 24: you are a level ahead, so Darkshore's kill and collect chains can go. What stays is what chapters 12 to 22 build on. Hearth = Sentinel Hill (leave it there)
[OC]|cffffcc00What you give up:|r every other Darkshore chain (Tharnariun's bears, the Blackwood ritual, Onu and the Master's Glaive, Gyromast, Murkdeep, the Stormscale coast, the beached creatures). None of it gates a later quest, trainer, recipe or flight path
[OC]|cffffcc00The order:|r boat to Auberdine > three pickups > Darnassus and back by bird > south for the Prospector's escort > Auberdine > the tower in the north-east > south for good, to Maestra's Post in Ashenvale

